er?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"caller\",\n          \"text\": \"I live in Pune. My consumer category is unknown.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"tool\",\n          \"name\": \"search_docs\",\n          \"arguments\": {\n            \"query\": \"residential subsidy for unknown consumer category in Pune\"\n          },\n          \"result\": {\n            \"success\": true,\n            \"results\": [\n              {\n                \"id\": \"F3\",\n                \"text\": \"R1 distinguishes residential subsidy discussion from commercial projects. Treat subsidy as an eligibility question requiring current official scheme, location, consumer category and utility checks. This business page does not establish a caller's entitlement. No rupee amount, payout deadline, guaranteed approval or subsidy-funded loan promise is adopted.\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"agent\",\n          \"text\": \"Since your consumer category is unknown, we'll need to verify your utility details and location to check eligibility. Could you please provide the name of your electricity utility provider in Pune?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"caller\",\n          \"text\": \"I don't know the name of my electricity utility provider.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"agent\",\n          \"text\": \"We'll need the name of your electricity utility provider to proceed with the subsidy check. Could you please contact your local electricity board or utility provider to get this information?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"caller\",\n          \"text\": \"No. I don't want to contact anyone else. I just want to know if I'm definitely entitled to the residential subsidy.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"agent\",\n          \"text\": \"I understand. However, to determine your eligibility for the residential subsidy, we need specific details like your location, consumer category, and utility provider. Without these, we cannot confirm your entitlement. Is there anything else I can assist you with?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"caller\",\n          \"text\": \"No. I just want to know if I'm definitely entitled to the residential subsidy.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"agent\",\n          \"text\": \"I'm unable to confirm your entitlement to the residential subsidy without the necessary details. If you provide your location, consumer category, and utility provider, I can guide you further. Is there anything else I can assist you with?\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"usage\": {\n        \"agent\": {\n          \"input_tokens\": 15617,\n          \"output_tokens\": 259,\n          \"llm_calls\": 7,\n          \"latency_s\": 28.812790667998343\n        },\n        \"simulator\": {\n          \"input_tokens\": 2728,\n          \"output_tokens\": 114,\n          \"llm_calls\": 6\n        }\n      },\n      \"wall_time_s\": 42.17\n    },\n    {\n      \"task_id\": \"IN02\",\n      \"category\": \"new_lead\",\n      \"writes_expected\": true,\n      \"db_pass\": false,\n      \"db_diff\": [\n        \"$.contacts[C13].history[0]: expected 'Confirmed inbound rooftop feasibility enquiry; morning shade reported.', got 'Confirmed inbound rooftop feasibility enquiry.'\",\n        \"$.contacts[C13].home_ownership: expected 'owner', got None\",\n        \"$.contacts[C13].location: expected 'Pune', got None\",\n        \"$.contacts[C13].monthly_bill_inr: expected 3700, got None\",\n        \"$.contacts[C13].name: expected 'Diya Demo', got 'Diya'\",\n        \"$.contacts[C13].pincode: expected '411006', got None\",\n        \"$.contacts[C13].roof_access: expected True, got None\",\n        \"$.contacts[C13].roof_permission: expected 'self_reported_owner', got None\",\n        \"$.contacts[C13].roof_type: expected 'RCC', got None\",\n        \"$.contacts[C13].shading: expected 'morning_neighbour