{"isSidechain":true,"agentId":"287e6059-7e93-427","type":"toolResult","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_c3e9ff9eada64118ac9b189c321eb6e5|fc_046d05bb6528bb34016afed0fac6e087d08f3024d1351e305b","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"AGENT: Hello, you've reached SunGrid Rooftop Solar. How can I help you today?\nCALLER: Hi, I want to check if I'm definitely entitled to a residential subsidy. My meter serves both my home and shop.\nTOOL search_docs({\"query\": \"residential subsidy for meters serving home and shop\"}) -> {\"success\": true, \"results\": [{\"id\": \"F3\", \"text\": \"R1 distinguishes residential subsidy discussion from commercial projects. Treat subsidy as an eligibility question requiring current official scheme, location, consumer category and utility checks. This business page does not establish a caller's entitlement. No rupee amount, payout deadline, guaranteed approval or subsidy-funded loan promise is \nAGENT: To determine your eligibility for the residential subsidy, we need to check your location, consumer category, and utility details. Could you please share your address and the name of your electricity utility provider?\nCALLER: I live in Pune. My consumer category is unknown.\nTOOL search_docs({\"query\": \"residential subsidy for unknown consumer category in Pune\"}) -> {\"success\": true, \"results\": [{\"id\": \"F3\", \"text\": \"R1 distinguishes residential subsidy discussion from commercial projects. Treat subsidy as an eligibility question requiring current official scheme, location, consumer category and utility checks. This business page does not establish a caller's entitlement. No rupee amount, payout deadline, guaranteed approval or subsidy-funded loan promise is \nAGENT: Since your consumer category is unknown, we'll need to verify your utility details and location to check eligibility. Could you please provide the name of your electricity utility provider in Pune?\nCALLER: I don't know the name of my electricity utility provider.\nAGENT: We'll need the name of your electricity utility provider to proceed with the subsidy check. Could you please contact your local electricity board or utility provider to get this information?\nCALLER: No. I don't want to contact anyone else. I just want to know if I'm definitely entitled to the residential subsidy.\nAGENT: I understand. However, to determine your eligibility for the residential subsidy, we need specific details like your location, consumer category, and utility provider. Without these, we cannot confirm your entitlement. Is there anything else I can assist you with?\nCALLER: No. I just want to know if I'm definitely entitled to the residential subsidy.\nAGENT: I'm unable to confirm your entitlement to the residential subsidy without the necessary details. If you provide your location, consumer category, and utility provider, I can guide you further. Is there anything else I can assist you with?\n"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":9,"timestamp":1795084539584},"timestamp":"2026-11-19T10:35:39.586Z","cwd":"/Users/srijan/projects/Group-6-DS-and-AI-Lab-Project"}
{"isSidechain":true,"agentId":"287e6059-7e93-427","type":"toolResult","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_8d1e6df362524f94b49b12cfaf71de27|fc_046d05bb6528bb34016afed0fac6e087d0a860ed7696b4ecc0","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"AGENT: Hello, you've reached SunGrid Rooftop Solar. How can I help you today?\nCALLER: Hi, I'm Diya. I'm checking if a rooftop solar system is feasible for my home in Pune.\nAGENT: I'm Diya. Could you please share your email address so I can check if you already have an enquiry with us?\nCALLER: diya@example.invalid\nTOOL find_lead({\"email\": \"diya@example.invalid\"}) -> {\"success\": true, \"email\": \"diya@example.invalid\", \"match_found\": false}\nAGENT: Great, Diya. It seems there's no existing enquiry for your email. Would you like me to create a new enquiry with your details?\nCALLER: Yes, I confirm. Please proceed to create the enquiry with my details.\nTOOL create_lead({\"pincode\": null, \"roof_access\": null, \"roof_permission\": null, \"roof_type\": null, \"shading\": null, \"name\": \"Diya\", \"email\": \"diya@example.invalid\", \"timeline_days\": null, \"home_ownership\": null, \"location\": null, \"monthly_bill_inr\": null}) -> {\"success\": true, \"id\": \"C13\", \"contact\": {\"id\": \"C13\", \"name\": \"Diya\", \"email\": \"diya@example.invalid\", \"home_ownership\": null, \"roof_type\": null, \"roof_access\": null, \"roof_permission\": null, \"shading\": null, \"monthly_bill_inr\": null, \"location\": null, \"pincode\": null, \"timeline_days\": null, \"status\": \"new\", \"consent\": false, \"consent_record\": null, \"opted_out\": false, \"attempts\": 0, \"last_attem\nAGENT: Your enquiry has been successfully created, Diya. The ID is C13. Now, could you please share your home ownership status (owner, co-owner, tenant, or unknown)?\nCALLER: Owner.\nTOOL update_lead({\"contact_id\": \"C13\", \"set\": {\"home_ownership\": \"owner\"}}) -> {\"success\": false, \"error\": \"identity_not_verified\", \"atomic\": true}\nAGENT: To update your details, I need to verify your identity. Could you please share your contact ID and email address?\nCALLER: No.\nAGENT: I understand. Since you're not willing to share your contact ID and email for verification, I cannot proceed with updating your details. Is there anything else I can assist you with?\n"}],"isError":false,"durationMs":9,"timestamp":1795084539584},"timestamp":"2026-11-19T10:35:39.586Z","cwd":"/Users/srijan/projects/Group-6-DS-and-AI-Lab-Project"}
